:"2026-02-25T11:49:50","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"中高级数字IC后端设计工程师(J11685)","OrgId":761597,"Org":"芯片设计部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["四川省·成都市","浙江省·杭州市"],"Salary":"30K-50K 元/月","Duty":"1. 负责Soc芯片从Netlist到GDSII的全流程后端设计工作，包括Floorplan、Power Plan、CTS、布局布线等；\n2. 和芯片前端设计团队密切配合，完成形式验证、Timing收敛、低功耗设计检查、物理验证、功耗及电源验证、可靠性验证等各项Signoff动作；\n3. 同时负责2.5D先进封装的Interposer设计工作，包括Floorplan、Layout以及bump的设计工作；\n4. 与封装团队密切配合，完成Interposer设计的DRC、LVS、3D Stack等Signoff工作；\n5. 负责后端设计相关文档的编写，包括设计方案，流程规范，后端设计/验证报告等。","Require":"1. 电子信息工程、微电子、集成电路设计等相关专业，本科及以上学历，3 年以上芯片数字后端设计工作经验；\n2. 精通数字后端全流程设计流程，深入理解 CMOS 工艺原理、物理设计约束、STA及低功耗设计技术；\n3. 熟练使用主流 EDA 工具如Innovus、PrimeTime、Calibre、StarRC等，能独立完成复杂模块或整芯片后端设计；\n4. 具备扎实的芯片物理设计理论基础，能解决Congestion、时序收敛困难、IR-Drop、SIPI等关键问题；\n5. 较强的自驱力和责任心, 严谨的工作态度， 出色的跨团队跨领域的合作能力。","ClassificationOne":"研发","ClassificationTwo":null,"Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":false,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":false,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-02-25T11:49:50","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,